  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of Makambako Wind Farm Phase IV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The agreement falls under Norad&apos;s Enterprise Development for Renewable Energy (EDRE) Scheme. Norad&#x2019;s early-stage support helps mitigate Norsk Vind&#x2019;s risks associated with project development.

Supported activities under this agreement include wind assessments, updates to previously conducted studies, the land acquisition process, contract negotiations with suppliers, and negotiations with national authorities in Tanzania, all aimed at achieving financial close.</narrative>
  </description>
